i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kvLsx66xYKwQ7kNvwFuq1yt&_nc_oc=AdqDykshvjQxj1uT-oCa8aHe_HSn0oMKZwNeisGWPQGPX-6nW5IhQy9sNxTnjLEk7tI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO9GS6bKfxPo8VNt5iDpJMZiErVq-s-bFYKsPIxM6YRKQ&oe=6AE345A3"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GqB1Ls2Ux3EQ7kNvwHTAQKW&_nc_oc=AdpwlBhlxQfg7fJG57vaIx9OMvhyBhZimZqxitTS28DK7JXuV4muu0JpXwVD8pDp-M0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOUnONhSQtdselSA6WSiErwL-5lIV6xLwYgQYKUpdjDgA&oe=6AE369DD"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yWgHMu9qIo0Q7kNvwG0m_Hu&_nc_oc=AdpVQpEEoo3cfBlmmu9_tLc4K7yMuUk8ZhCbgrMuZLLAKm6c4xCDGnhpRR3lqsDIYA8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNIE4EHpZzCdUOg7bE8H3weIJixWAF1h-Y8-AkhNfbhlg&oe=6AE3584A"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im